   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress Report on Digital Trade Office</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Attract and Unite Stakeholders: The Digital Trade Office aims to attract and unite GNBCC members, along with broader PSD community participants, including the Horticulture Business Platform, Diaspora, Women in Business, Dutch Export Academy, and Youth in Food.
2.	Facilitate Access to Opportunities: The platform offers opportunities such as client acquisition, weekly newsletters, event invitations, training, and e-learning, enabling users to enhance their business prospects.
3.	Foster Networking: Users can establish connections with organizations and individuals, expanding their professional network.
4.	Serve as Talent Pool: The platform provides a resource for employers by offering a pool of suitable candidates for job vacancies, contributing to talent acquisition within the community.</narrative>
   </description>
